#: internal/auth/signin/recover.go:257
msgid ""
"\n"
"Hi,\n"
"\n"
"You (or someone else) entered this email address when trying to\n"
"change the password of a Readeck account (%[1]s).\n"
"\n"
"If you are expecting this email, please follow this link to set\n"
"a new password for your readeck account.\n"
"\n"
"%[2]s\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Ahoj,\n"
"\n"
"Ty (alebo niekto iný) si zadal túto e-mailovú adresu\n"
"pri pokuse o zmenu hesla k účtu Readeck (%[1]s).\n"
"\n"
"Ak si tento e-mail očakával, klikni na tento odkaz a \n"
"nastav si nové heslo k svojmu účtu Readeck.\n"
"\n"
"%[2]s\n"

#: internal/auth/signin/recover.go:271
msgid ""
"\n"
"Hi,\n"
"\n"
"You (or someone else) entered this email address when trying to\n"
"change the password of a Readeck account (%[1]s).\n"
"\n"
"However, this email address is not associated with any account and\n"
"therefore, the attempted password change has failed.\n"
"\n"
"If you are a Readeck user on %[1]s and you are\n"
"expecting this email, please try again using the email address\n"
"you used when creating your account.\n"
"\n"
"If you are not a Readeck user, please ignore this message.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Dobrý deň,\n"
"\n"
"vy (alebo niekto iný) ste zadali túto e-mailovú adresu pri \n"
"pokuse o zmenu hesla k účtu Readeck (%[1]s).\n"
"\n"
"Táto e-mailová adresa však nie je priradená k žiadnemu účtu, a\n"
"preto pokus o zmenu hesla zlyhal.\n"
"\n"
"Ak ste používateľom služby Readeck na %[1]s a tento e-mail\n"
"ste očakávali, skúste to znova pomocou e-mailovej adresy, \n"
"ktorú ste použili pri vytváraní účtu.\n"
"\n"
"Ak nie ste používateľom služby Readeck, túto správu ignorujte.\n"

